OL,3,GNEWSASetbacks for building fire safety
OL,4,Aworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor safety works across a city's
OL,7,Fcouncil homes are facing staff
OL,8,Fshortages, unexpected repairs and
OL,9,Fdelays, according to a new report.
OL,11,FPortsmouth City Council is carrying out
OL,12,Fa major programme of building works
OL,13,Facross its housing stock.
OL,15,FA report to Darren Sanders, the
OL,16,Fcouncil's cabinet member for housing
OL,17,Fand tackling homelessness, sets out
OL,18,Fprogress on fire safety work across
OL,19,Fhigh-rise, mid-rise and low-rise
OL,20,Fblocks.
